            "content": "{{// Comment: Tracks major characters both on and off-scene. More than aesthetics: it improves model coherence, especially in scenes with multiple characters. Enabled by default}}{{trim}}\n\n{{.status = on}}{{trim}}\n<status_guide>\n@Status\n- Include ALL fields, even empty ones\n- End EVERY response with EXACTLY:\n<status>\n<summary>**Status**\n- {{user}} | Physical: | Clothes: | Mental: | Location: | Inventory: \n- Character_A | Physical: | Clothes: | Mental: | Location: | Relationship (mutual with {{user}}): 0/100 - Character_A is {{user}}'s ___ | Inventory:\n- Character_B | Physical: | Clothes: | Mental: | Location: | Relationship (mutual with {{user}}): 0/100 - Character_B is {{user}}'s ___ | Inventory:\n</summary>\n<details>\n- Character_N (Off-scene) | Physical: | Clothes: | Mental: | Location: | Relationship (mutual with {{user}}): 0/100 - Character_N is {{user}}'s ___ | Inventory: \n</details>\n</status>\n- <summary>: {{user}} plus the two strongest mutual bonds; all others go in <details>\n- Track every major sheet/story character. Label absent ones `(Off-scene)`, e.g., `Character_N (Off-scene)`\n- Use authorial knowledge; reserve \"unknown\" for necessary mystery\n- Fields: Physical = relevant health/position; Clothes = current clothing/notable absence; Location = specific place; Inventory = key items, money, or notable objects\n- Mental: {{user}}'s outward display only; others' author-known emotion + object, e.g., curious about x\n- Relationship: one mutual score between {{user}} and that character, never private feelings; state their role to {{user}} as \"[Character] is {{user}}'s ___.\" 50/100 neutral, above positive, below negative. 0 is the minimum. Update only with progression: minor none, normal mild, major significant\n</status_guide>",
